      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 2,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "text": "Allah has sealed their hearts and their hearing, and their sight is covered[6]; and for them there will be a great punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 2,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "text": "There are some people[7] who say, “We believe in Allah and the Last Day,” whereas they are not believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "text": "They seek to deceive Allah and those who believe, while they deceive none but themselves, but they do not realize.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "text": "In their hearts is a sickness[8], and Allah increased their sickness, and they will have a painful punishment for their persistent lying.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "text": "When it is said to them, “Do not spread corruption in the land,” they say, “We are only reformers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "text": "Indeed, it is they who spread corruption, but they do not realize.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "text": "When it is said to them, “Believe as the people have believed,” they say, “Shall we believe as the fools[9] have believed?” Indeed, it is they who are the fools, but they do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "text": "When they meet those who believe, they say, “We believe.” But when they are alone with their evil ones[10], they say, “We are certainly with you; we were only mocking.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "text": "Allah will mock them[11] and prolong them to wander blindly in their transgression.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cow",
        "numberOfAyahs": 286,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 1,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 3,
      "ruku": 3,
      "hizbQuarter": 1,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "text": "They are those who purchased misguidance for guidance, but their trade was profitless, and they were not guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
